-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §4 הגדרות לעניין הסכם זה: a teaching
-- employee, a teacher, an existing and a new teaching employee or teacher,
-- a principal, an existing and a new principal, and a school.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-2`
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `4 הגדרות לעניין הסכם זה`

@desc Where a teaching employee stood on a given eve, as §4(ג)(1) and (ו)(1) ask.
DECLARE `standing on an eve under section 4` IS ONE OF
    @desc taught, in fact, with an employer–employee relation with one of the employers
    `teaching for one of the employers`
    @desc served, in fact, as a school principal, with an employer–employee relation with one of the employers
    `managing a school for one of the employers`
    @desc on unpaid leave (חל"ת) or a sabbatical, in employment as a teaching employee or teacher with one of the employers
    `on leave from teaching for one of the employers`
    @desc on unpaid leave or a sabbatical, in employment as a school principal with one of the employers
    `on leave from managing a school for one of the employers`
    `none of these`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as the definitions of §4 ask.
DECLARE `Oz staff member` HAS
    `as section 2 sees them`                    IS A `Oz section 2 employee`
    `teaches grades 10 to 14`                   IS A BOOLEAN @desc teaches pupils in grades י'–י"ב, or י"ג–י"ד where the school has them
    `teaches grade 9`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `serves as a school principal`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `appointed principal by the employer's rules` IS A BOOLEAN
    `standing on the eve of signing`            IS A `standing on an eve under section 4` @desc on 13.8.2011
    `standing on the eve of moving to the reform` IS A `standing on an eve under section 4`
    `began with one of the employers in 5772 to 5775` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaching years recognised for salary seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc with another employer, or with the same one before a break in teaching
    `of them an internship year`                IS A NUMBER
    `of them teaching in army or national service` IS A NUMBER
    `of them seniority for compulsory army or national service` IS A NUMBER
    `first appointed a principal in 5772`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `under the reform in 5772, fully or in part` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `4(א)`

-- "עובד הוראה" is as §2 defines it: one the agreement covers.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee under the Oz agreement` m IF
    `the Oz agreement covers` (m's `as section 2 sees them`)

§§ `4(ב)`

-- "מורה": one who teaches pupils in grades 10–12 (in a four-year school,
-- 9–12), or in grades 13–14 where the school has them, and is not a school
-- principal.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher under the Oz agreement` m IF
        (    m's `teaches grades 10 to 14`
         OR (    m's `teaches grade 9`
             AND m's `as section 2 sees them`'s `the kind of school` EQUALS `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`))
    AND NOT m's `serves as a school principal`

§§ `4(ג)`

-- (ג)(2) ¶2–¶3: the years that count leave out an internship year,
-- teaching done in army or national service, and seniority for compulsory
-- army or national service.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_2/p3
GIVEN s IS A `standing on an eve under section 4`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaching, managing or on leave for one of the employers` s IF
    NOT s EQUALS `none of these`

GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teaching years that count under 4(ג)(2)` m IS
    max 0 (m's `teaching years recognised for salary seniority`
           MINUS m's `of them an internship year`
           MINUS m's `of them teaching in army or national service`
           MINUS m's `of them seniority for compulsory army or national service`)

-- (ג): an existing teaching employee or teacher is one of two. (1): on the
-- eve of the signing AND on the eve of his own move to the reform, he
-- taught or managed a school in fact for one of the employers (א), or was
-- on unpaid leave or a sabbatical from such employment (ב). (2): he began
-- with one of the employers in the school years תשע"ב–תשע"ה and is
-- entitled, for salary seniority, to recognition of teaching years with
-- another employer, or with the same one before a break.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_1__cls_b akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_2
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing teaching employee under the Oz agreement` m IF
        (    `teaching, managing or on leave for one of the employers` (m's `standing on the eve of signing`)
         AND `teaching, managing or on leave for one of the employers` (m's `standing on the eve of moving to the reform`))
    OR  (    m's `began with one of the employers in 5772 to 5775`
         AND `the teaching years that count under 4(ג)(2)` m GREATER THAN 0)

§§ `4(ד)`

@ref akn:art_4__para_d
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teaching employee under the Oz agreement` m IF
    NOT `an existing teaching employee under the Oz agreement` m

§§ `4(ה)`

-- "מנהל": a teaching employee who serves as principal of a six-year school
-- (7–12) or a four-year school (9–12), grades 13–14 included, appointed by
-- the employer's rules. The clause does not name the three-year school,
-- which (ח) makes a school of the agreement and §2 covers: read from the
-- nearest provision (convention reading.analogy), its principal is a
-- principal too (F-oz-founding-4-a).
@ref akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a principal under the Oz agreement` m IF
        `a teaching employee under the Oz agreement` m
    AND m's `serves as a school principal`
    AND m's `appointed principal by the employer's rules`
    AND `has a three- or four-year upper division` (m's `as section 2 sees them`'s `the kind of school`)

-- The kinds of school (ה)'s words name.
`the kinds of school 4(ה) names` MEANS
    LIST `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`, `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`

§§ `4(ו)`

-- (ו): an existing principal is one of two. (1): on the eve of the
-- signing AND on the eve of his own move to the reform, he served in fact
-- as a principal for one of the employers (א), or was on unpaid leave or a
-- sabbatical from that post (ב). (2): he was first appointed a principal
-- in תשע"ב and is employed under the reform, fully or in part, in תשע"ב.
@ref akn:art_4__para_f akn:art_4__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_f__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_4__para_f__subpara_1__cls_b akn:art_4__para_f__subpara_2
GIVEN s IS A `standing on an eve under section 4`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `managing or on leave from managing for one of the employers` s IF
       s EQUALS `managing a school for one of the employers`
    OR s EQUALS `on leave from managing a school for one of the employers`

GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m IF
        `a principal under the Oz agreement` m
    AND (    (    `managing or on leave from managing for one of the employers` (m's `standing on the eve of signing`)
              AND `managing or on leave from managing for one of the employers` (m's `standing on the eve of moving to the reform`))
         OR  (m's `first appointed a principal in 5772` AND m's `under the reform in 5772, fully or in part`))

§§ `4(ז)`

@ref akn:art_4__para_g
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m IF
    `a principal under the Oz agreement` m AND NOT `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m

§§ `4(ח)`

-- "בית ספר": an education institution under the Compulsory Education Law,
-- 1949, teaching grades 10–12 within a six-year institution, 9–12 in a
-- four-year one, or a three-year one (10–12), grades 13–14 included.
-- Whether an institution is one under that law is a fact of the case: the
-- law is outside the corpus.
@ref akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN k IS A `kind of Oz school`, `an education institution under the Compulsory Education Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a school under the Oz agreement` k `an education institution under the Compulsory Education Law` IF
        `an education institution under the Compulsory Education Law`
    AND `has a three- or four-year upper division` k

`why whether an institution is one under the Compulsory Education Law is a fact` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק לימוד חובה, תש\"ט-1949"

§§ `4 -- illustrations`

GIVEN k IS A `kind of Oz school`
GIVETH A `Oz section 2 employee`
DECIDE `a covered upper-division employee in` k IS
    `Oz section 2 employee` WITH
        `ranked on the teaching employees' grade`          IS TRUE
        `represented by the organisation of secondary teachers` IS TRUE
        `employed by one of the employers`                 IS TRUE
        `the kind of school`                               IS k
        `employed in the school's upper division`          IS TRUE
        `the school is supervised by the Ministry`         IS TRUE

-- A principal appointed by the rules, in office on both eves.
GIVEN k IS A `kind of Oz school`
GIVETH A `Oz staff member`
DECIDE `a serving principal of` k IS
    `Oz staff member` WITH
        `as section 2 sees them`                    IS `a covered upper-division employee in` k
        `teaches grades 10 to 14`                   IS TRUE
        `teaches grade 9`                           IS FALSE
        `serves as a school principal`              IS TRUE
        `appointed principal by the employer's rules` IS TRUE
        `standing on the eve of signing`            IS `managing a school for one of the employers`
        `standing on the eve of moving to the reform` IS `managing a school for one of the employers`
        `began with one of the employers in 5772 to 5775` IS FALSE
        `teaching years recognised for salary seniority` IS 0
        `of them an internship year`                IS 0
        `of them teaching in army or national service` IS 0
        `of them seniority for compulsory army or national service` IS 0
        `first appointed a principal in 5772`       IS FALSE
        `under the reform in 5772, fully or in part` IS FALSE

-- A teacher hired in תשע"ג, whose only earlier teaching was his internship
-- year: none of his years counts, so he is a new teacher.
`a teacher hired in 5773 after an internship year` MEANS
    `Oz staff member` WITH
        `as section 2 sees them`                    IS `a covered upper-division employee in` `a three-year school, grades 10 to 12`
        `teaches grades 10 to 14`                   IS TRUE
        `teaches grade 9`                           IS FALSE
        `serves as a school principal`              IS FALSE
        `appointed principal by the employer's rules` IS FALSE
        `standing on the eve of signing`            IS `none of these`
        `standing on the eve of moving to the reform` IS `teaching for one of the employers`
        `began with one of the employers in 5772 to 5775` IS TRUE
        `teaching years recognised for salary seniority` IS 1
        `of them an internship year`                IS 1
        `of them teaching in army or national service` IS 0
        `of them seniority for compulsory army or national service` IS 0
        `first appointed a principal in 5772`       IS FALSE
        `under the reform in 5772, fully or in part` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `a teacher under the Oz agreement` `a teacher hired in 5773 after an internship year`
#ASSERT `a new teaching employee under the Oz agreement` `a teacher hired in 5773 after an internship year`
#ASSERT `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` (`a serving principal of` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`)
#ASSERT NOT `a teacher under the Oz agreement` (`a serving principal of` `a six-year school, grades 7 to 12`)

-- F-oz-founding-4-a: a three-year school is a school of the agreement
-- (ח), and its principal a teaching employee of it (§2); (ה)'s words name
-- only the six- and four-year school, so by them he would be no "מנהל",
-- and no "מורה" either, for (ב) leaves out every principal.
GIVEN k IS A `kind of Oz school`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `4(ה)'s words leave out the principal of a school of the agreement` k IF
        `a school under the Oz agreement` k TRUE
    AND `a teaching employee under the Oz agreement` (`a serving principal of` k)
    AND NOT elem k `the kinds of school 4(ה) names`
    AND NOT `a teacher under the Oz agreement` (`a serving principal of` k)

#ASSERT `4(ה)'s words leave out the principal of a school of the agreement` `a three-year school, grades 10 to 12`
#ASSERT NOT `4(ה)'s words leave out the principal of a school of the agreement` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`
#ASSERT `a principal under the Oz agreement` (`a serving principal of` `a three-year school, grades 10 to 12`)
